# Build products. Everything here is regenerated by `make` and `make cia`, and
# the shipped CIA is attached to a GitHub Release rather than committed - a
# 3.7 MB binary per version would bloat the history for no benefit.
build/
*.3dsx
*.elf
*.cia
*.smdh
*.banner
*.bnr

# The host test harness compiles and runs entirely inside a scratch directory
# passed on the command line, so nothing of it should ever appear here. This is
# a backstop for a run with no argument.
test/work/
